  "bodyHtml": "<p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5191295/19181fe57bd1cb2eccad94088da9b88a14956bd988d1ecb3e079bbae273e4eb3.png\" data-tempno=\"187686881\" alt=\"viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce786fa1bd625312d4f8c89e7ee4af4dd6fd9f77cbc0d990e2471b715be45169bc65e8e7279bd5bc054eb91025e5b6346b476757fdc703d\"></p>\n<p><br>Lastest Update 26.09.25<br>삭제된 공략 제보 및 신규 공략 등록은 이 게시글 댓글에 달아주면 반영할게용</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span><b><br>솔로레이드 TIP</b></span></p>\n<p>▶ <a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/gov/3770910\" target=\"_blank\">최저렙 및 덱조합 링크 모음</a>&nbsp;(업데이트 종료)</p>\n<p>▶ <a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/gov/3594287\" target=\"_blank\">빠르게하는 팁</a></p><p>▶ <a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=gov&amp;no=5899249\" target=\"_blank\">뮤지엄 1초컷 자동 계산기 만들어봄</a><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span><b>종합공략</b></span></p><p>▶&nbsp;<a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=gov&amp;no=5745901\" target=\"_blank\">뉴비용 뮤지엄 6종 챌린지 공략</a>&nbsp;(26.07.01)</p><p>▶ <a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=gov&amp;no=5906635\" target=\"_blank\">하베, 인디, 크챔 20단 / 싱크로761</a>&nbsp;(26.07.27)<br></p>\n<p>▶ <a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=gov&amp;no=5893158\" target=\"_blank\">하베, 인디 , 크챔 20단 / 싱크로791</a> (26.07.24)</p><p><br></p><p><span><b>최저렙 정리</b></span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5191295/cb99b6088c92fa6d3aaa02debadddc74f3e6285b5d2c491415a08e21cdd9e660.png\" data-fileno=\"4774839\" alt=\"a67314aa2232b4518aff5a60ea5de4ddb3289fc0e070fe92a03736335c817dcdf41d\"></p>\n\n<p><br></p><p>* 소괄호( ) 안의 숫자는 실제로 달성한 단수.</p><p><br></p>\n<p><span><b>HALL1</b></span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5191295/c568e0f8caa3c0d8e76dd81b72783c57d0c1b45080e1505868d9a7853d02f339.png\" data-tempno=\"187686942\" alt=\"viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce786fa1bd625312d4f8c89e7ee4af4dd6